cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PaStA, please cite the paper below."
title: "PaStA — the Panchromatic Stellar Atlas"
abstract: >-
  Software that builds and verifies the Panchromatic Stellar Atlas, a
  cross-match of Gaia DR3, the GALEX All-sky Imaging Survey and AllWISE
  giving 9,705,879 sources with twelve-band photometry from 0.15 to 22 micron.
